-- 1. 193 records, one per unit of an official Gymnasium Lehrplan: Bayern, Sachsen, Sachsen-Anhalt (Biologie and Informatik) and
--    Thüringen (Informatik and Medienbildung und Informatik). Titles, grades and hours are as the Lehrplan states them. Topic tags and
--    the short summary were written when each unit was recorded and have not been checked by a person. Each unit carries the address of
--    the official page it was read from.
-- 2. 87 proposed links from parts of Bio-Core, Computational-Core and Interdisciplinary to those units.
